WEBVTT

00:09.068 --> 00:10.172
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.206 --> 00:11.965
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.000 --> 00:13.448
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.482 --> 00:15.517
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.551 --> 00:18.586
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.620 --> 00:20.689
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.724 --> 00:22.862
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.896 --> 00:24.655
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.689 --> 00:26.517
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.551 --> 00:28.758
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.793 --> 00:30.344
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.379 --> 00:32.793
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.724
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.758 --> 00:36.758
all: ♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有人：♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.793 --> 00:38.724
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.758 --> 00:40.655
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.689 --> 00:41.862
- ♪ SPONGEBOB
- ♪ 海绵宝宝

00:41.896 --> 00:44.103
♪ SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 方裤！

00:44.137 --> 00:46.620
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.655 --> 00:48.862
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.896 --> 00:50.275
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:04.413 --> 01:06.310
- OH, BOY, JELLYFISHING!
- 哦，天哪，钓水母！

01:06.344 --> 01:07.655
I CAN'T WAIT.
我等不及了。

01:07.689 --> 01:09.586
CAN YOU, PATRICK?
你可以吗，帕特里克？

01:09.620 --> 01:11.206
- [slurping]
- PATRICK?
- [发出声音]
- 帕特里克？

01:11.241 --> 01:12.724
- DID YOU SAY SOMETHING?
- 你有说什么吗？

01:12.758 --> 01:14.137
- UGH.
I SAID--
- 呃。
我说——

01:14.172 --> 01:15.344
OW!
噢！

01:15.379 --> 01:17.655
- I'M NOT SURE
HOW TO RESPOND TO THAT.
- 我不确定
如何应对？

01:17.689 --> 01:19.793
- [gasps]
MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY.
- [喘气]
美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩。

01:19.827 --> 01:21.689
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:21.724 --> 01:24.689
- HEY.
WE'RE STUCK HERE, REMEMBER?
- 嘿。
我们被困在这里，还记得吗？

01:24.724 --> 01:26.310
- WHY IS THAT?
- 这是为什么？

01:26.344 --> 01:29.103
- BECAUSE YOU FORGOT TO FILL UP
THE BOATMOBILE BEFORE WE LEFT.
- 因为你忘了加油
我们离开之前的机动船。

01:29.137 --> 01:30.896
SEE?
看？

01:30.931 --> 01:32.965
- HEY, HEROES.
- 嘿，英雄们。

01:33.000 --> 01:34.655
IS THERE ANYTHING WE CAN DO?
我们能做些什么吗？

01:38.620 --> 01:39.896
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

01:46.586 --> 01:48.275
- THIS IS A HEAVY PIECE
OF NOTHIN'.
- 这是一个沉重的部分
什么都没有。

01:48.310 --> 01:50.413
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

01:50.448 --> 01:51.896
SO IS THAT IT?
是这样吗？

01:51.931 --> 01:53.551
- YES, THANK YOU, BOYS.
- 是的，谢谢你们，孩子们。

01:53.586 --> 01:55.448
WE USUALLY DON'T DO THIS,
BUT IN RETURN
我们通常不这样做，
但作为回报

01:55.482 --> 01:58.448
FOR PUSHING THE INVISIBOAT
UP ALL THOSE HILLS,
用于推动 Invisiboat
爬上所有这些山丘，

01:58.482 --> 02:00.689
THERE'S SOMETHING
I'D LIKE YOU TO SEE.
有东西
我想让你看看。

02:00.724 --> 02:04.827
BUT YOU MUST PROMISE
NOT TO TOUCH ANYTHING.
但你必须承诺
不要碰任何东西。

02:04.862 --> 02:06.413
both:
OKAY.
两者：
好的。

02:11.344 --> 02:13.241
- WHOA!
- WOW!
- 哇！
- 哇！

02:13.275 --> 02:15.793
- OOH! THE MAGIC CLAW
FROM EPISODE 1582!
- 哦！魔爪
从第1582集开始！

02:15.827 --> 02:17.758
[gasps]
MAN RAY'S POWER GLOVE!
[喘气]
曼·雷的力量手套！

02:17.793 --> 02:20.068
- OOH!
A PAIR OF BINOCULARS.
- 哦！
一副双筒望远镜。

02:20.103 --> 02:23.137
- YES, BOYS, THIS IS OUR LOCKER
OF MEMORIES.
- 是的，孩子们，这是我们的储物柜
回忆。

02:23.172 --> 02:26.310
IT CONTAINS...
它包含...

02:26.344 --> 02:27.551
I CAN'T REMEMBER.
我不记得了。

02:27.586 --> 02:29.206
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

02:29.241 --> 02:32.586
IT CONTAINS ALL THE MEMORABILIA
FROM OUR SUPERHUMAN ADVENTURES.
它包含所有纪念品
来自我们的超人冒险。

02:32.620 --> 02:34.689
- WHOA!
HEY, SPONGEBOB, CHECK IT OUT.
- 哇！
嘿，海绵宝宝，看看。

02:34.724 --> 02:36.068
- THE DIRTY BUBBLE'S
BUBBLE WAND.
- 肮脏的泡泡
泡泡棒。

02:36.103 --> 02:37.034
- CORRECT.
- 正确的。

02:40.000 --> 02:42.275
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

02:45.034 --> 02:46.551
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:46.586 --> 02:47.931
SCARED, BOYS?
孩子们，害怕了吗？

02:47.965 --> 02:49.103
- MM-HMM.
- YEAH.
- 嗯嗯。
- 是的。

02:49.137 --> 02:51.482
- WELL, DON'T BE.
- 好吧，别这样。

02:51.517 --> 02:53.724
- AND AS LONG AS NO ONE
TOUCHES ANYTHING,
- 只要没有人
触及任何东西，

02:53.758 --> 02:55.655
THERE'S NOTHING HERE
TO BE SCARED OF.
这里什么都没有
害怕。

02:55.689 --> 02:57.379
- UNDERSTOOD.
- 明白了。

02:57.413 --> 02:59.344
- AND THIS
IS OUR TIME MACHINE.
-还有这个
是我们的时间机器。

02:59.379 --> 03:00.827
THIS DEVICE ALLOWS US
该设备使我们能够

03:00.862 --> 03:03.206
TO TRANSPORT
INTO THE FUTURE OR PAST,
前往交通
进入未来或过去，

03:03.241 --> 03:05.827
AT A DATE OR DESTINATION
OF OUR CHOOSING.
在某个日期或目的地
我们的选择。

03:05.862 --> 03:07.310
- WHOA.
- OOH.
- 哇哦。
-哦。

03:07.344 --> 03:08.827
- UNFORTUNATELY,
THE CONSEQUENCES
- 不幸的是，
后果

03:08.862 --> 03:11.379
OF ALTERING THE ORDER OF HISTORY
ARE SO DANGEROUS,
改变历史秩序
如此危险，

03:11.413 --> 03:12.896
WE'VE CHOSEN
TO LEAVE IT ALONE.
我们选择了
不去管它。

03:12.931 --> 03:15.206
SO YOU MUSTN'T TOUCH.
所以你绝对不能碰。

03:15.241 --> 03:17.724
- HEY, THIS SNACK MACHINE
TOOK MY QUARTER.
- 嘿，这台零食机
拿走了我的四分之一。

03:17.758 --> 03:19.517
I WANT MY CRUNCHITY MUNCHITIES.
我想要松脆的零食。

03:19.551 --> 03:21.275
- NO!
- 不！

03:21.310 --> 03:22.344
- STUPID BOX.
- 愚蠢的盒子。

03:24.862 --> 03:26.793
[machine whirring]
[机器呼呼地响]

03:26.827 --> 03:28.620
YOU REALLY GOT TO GET
THAT THING FIXED.
你真的必须得到
那件事已经解决了。

03:28.655 --> 03:29.758
- YOU FOOL!
- 你这个傻瓜！

03:29.793 --> 03:31.103
DO YOU REALIZE
WHAT YOU'VE DONE?
你知道吗
你做了什么？

03:31.137 --> 03:32.689
- WELL, I LOST A QUARTER.
- 好吧，我输了四分之一。

03:39.310 --> 03:41.655
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:02.896 --> 04:06.172
- WHERE ARE WE?
- 我们在哪里？

04:06.206 --> 04:07.965
[gasps]
IT CAN'T BE.
[喘气]
不可能。

04:08.000 --> 04:10.517
BIKINI BOTTOM HAS
AT LEAST 39 PEOPLE LIVING HERE.
比基尼泳裤有
至少有 39 人住在这里。

04:10.551 --> 04:12.034
MAYBE AS YOU KNEW IT,
也许如您所知，

04:12.068 --> 04:15.034
BUT THIS IS A DIFFERENT
BIKINI BOTTOM OF ANOTHER TIME.
但这是不同的
另一次的比基尼下装。

04:15.068 --> 04:17.448
MAYBE IF YOU HADN'T TOUCHED
THE TIME MACHINE
也许如果你没有碰过
时间机器

04:17.482 --> 04:20.965
LIKE WE TOLD YOU, PATRICK,
WE WOULDN'T BE IN THIS MESS.
就像我们告诉你的，帕特里克，
我们不会陷入这样的混乱。

04:21.000 --> 04:23.896
HOPEFULLY WE HAVEN'T CHANGED
ANYTHING WITH OUR PRESENCE.
希望我们没有改变
只要有我们的存在，一切皆有可能。

04:23.931 --> 04:26.413
- OOH, EVERYTHING LOOKS
SO OLD-FASHIONED.
- 哦，一切看起来
太老式了。

04:26.448 --> 04:28.862
[twangy banjo music]
[班卓琴音乐]

04:28.896 --> 04:30.482
[sea horse whinnies]
[海马嘶嘶声]

04:38.896 --> 04:43.310
[dramatic music
and evil laughter]
[戏剧音乐
和邪恶的笑声]

04:43.344 --> 04:45.586
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

04:45.620 --> 04:49.620
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

04:49.655 --> 04:52.931
I'M READY TO RULE THE WORLD
AND ITS RICHES.
我已准备好统治世界
及其财富。

04:52.965 --> 04:55.620
WITH THIS WEAPON,
NOTHING CAN STOP ME.
有了这个武器，
没有什么可以阻止我。

04:55.655 --> 04:57.551
- THAT'S WHAT YOU THINK.
- 这就是你的想法。

04:57.586 --> 05:00.000
- MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY?
- 美人鱼人
还有藤壶男孩？

05:00.034 --> 05:01.551
- SORRY, MAN RAY,
- 对不起，曼雷，

05:01.586 --> 05:04.724
BUT MY STALWART COMPANION,
BARNACLE BOY, AND I
但我坚定的伙伴，
藤壶男孩和我

05:04.758 --> 05:06.172
BEG TO DIFFER WITH YOU.
恳求与您不同。

05:06.206 --> 05:07.827
- YOU'VE TANGLED
WITH THE WRONG END
- 你很纠结
结局错误

05:07.862 --> 05:09.931
OF THE FISH HOOK
OF JUSTICE, MAN RAY.
鱼钩的
正义之士，曼·雷。

05:09.965 --> 05:11.965
- NOW PREPARE
FOR A HEAPING HELPING
- 现在准备
寻求帮助

05:12.000 --> 05:15.620
OF QUICK-DRYING TARTAR SAUCE.
速干塔塔酱。

05:15.655 --> 05:18.206
- WOW, OUR BODIES
WERE SO TIGHT.
- 哇，我们的身体
太紧了。

05:18.241 --> 05:19.689
- WHAT WENT WRONG?
- 出了什么问题？

05:19.724 --> 05:21.137
- GAH!
- 嘎啊！

05:22.862 --> 05:24.586
- JUMPIN' JELLYFISH,
MERMAID MAN.
- 跳跃水母，
美人鱼男人。

05:24.620 --> 05:25.896
WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE TARTAR SAUCE?
发生了什么
鞑靼酱？

05:27.827 --> 05:29.482
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

05:29.517 --> 05:32.344
GOOD THING THAT WAS AROUND.
I WAS STARVING.
周围有好事。
我快饿死了。

05:32.379 --> 05:33.827
- CURIOUS.
- 好奇的。

05:33.862 --> 05:35.965
COULD I HAVE FORGOTTEN
TO REFILL IT?
难道我忘记了
要重新填充它吗？

05:36.000 --> 05:38.172
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

05:38.206 --> 05:39.827
- THIS IS CREEPING ME OUT.
- 这让我感到害怕。

05:39.862 --> 05:42.448
- PATRICK, WHAT ABOUT
MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY?
- 帕特里克，那又怎么样
美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩？

05:42.482 --> 05:44.137
- I DON'T GOT TIME FOR THAT.
- 我没有时间。

05:44.172 --> 05:46.620
- WHERE ARE YOU GOING, BOYS?
- 孩子们，你们要去哪里？

05:46.655 --> 05:48.586
- I JUST WANT TO GO HOME!
- 我只想回家！

05:49.655 --> 05:51.517
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

05:51.551 --> 05:52.931
- WHEN ARE WE GONNA
HAVE THOSE TWO
- 我们什么时候去
有那两个

05:52.965 --> 05:54.310
RECLASSIFIED AS VILLAINS?
重新归类为恶棍？

05:56.586 --> 05:57.689
- THEY LEFT US HERE!
- 他们把我们留在这里了！

05:57.724 --> 05:59.379
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?
我们要做什么？

05:59.413 --> 06:02.275
EH, I'M SURE
IT'LL ALL WORK OUT.
呃，我确定
一切都会成功的。

06:02.310 --> 06:04.862
- DON'T WORRY,
MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY
- 别担心，
美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩

06:04.896 --> 06:07.172
ARE ALWAYS HERE
TO HELP THE ELDERLY.
一直在这里
帮助老人。

06:07.206 --> 06:10.724
THERE'S SOMETHING FAMILIAR
ABOUT THESE TWO, BARNACLE BOY.
有一些熟悉的东西
关于这两个人，藤壶男孩。

06:10.758 --> 06:13.068
I JUST CAN'T PUT MY FLIPPER
ON IT.
我就是放不下脚蹼
就它而言。

06:13.103 --> 06:14.827
- HEY, NEAT HAT.
- 嘿，漂亮的帽子。

06:14.862 --> 06:17.724
- THANKS, I--
- 谢谢，我--

06:17.758 --> 06:20.344
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

06:20.379 --> 06:22.689
- LET'S GET THESE POOR,
DEFENSELESS SENIORS
- 让我们把这些穷人变穷，
手无寸铁的老年人

06:22.724 --> 06:23.965
OUT OF HARM'S WAY.
远离伤害。

06:25.724 --> 06:28.586
both: WHOA!
两人：哇！

06:36.103 --> 06:37.655
- THAT'S MORE LIKE IT--
- 更像是这样--

06:37.689 --> 06:40.793
BACK IN GOOD OLE PRESENT-DAY
BIKINI BOTTOM.
回到美好的现在
比基尼下装。

06:43.275 --> 06:44.758
- YES, PATRICK.
- 是的，帕特里克。

06:44.793 --> 06:46.724
WE'RE ALL BORN
IN OUR OWN PLACE AND TIME.
我们都出生了
在我们自己的地点和时间。

06:46.758 --> 06:48.724
HELLO, FELLOW CITIZEN.
你好，公民同胞。

06:54.068 --> 06:55.689
HELLO, SQUILLIAM.
你好，史奎廉。

06:55.724 --> 06:57.034
- MAN RAY IS GREAT.
- 曼雷很棒。

06:57.068 --> 06:58.758
- YEAH.
- 是的。

06:58.793 --> 07:01.344
MUST BE TAKING CARE OF HIS
COMMUNITY SERVICE OBLIGATIONS.
必须照顾他的
社区服务义务。

07:01.379 --> 07:03.000
- THAT'LL TEACH HIM TO JAYWALK.
- 这会教他乱穿马路。

07:08.344 --> 07:10.000
- SAY, UH, PATRICK,
- 呃，帕特里克，

07:10.034 --> 07:13.034
DO YOU NOTICE ANYTHING DIFFERENT
ABOUT OUR FAIR CITY?
你注意到有什么不同吗
关于我们的公平城市？

07:13.068 --> 07:14.482
- SORRY, I COULDN'T HEAR YOU
- 抱歉，我听不到你说话

07:14.517 --> 07:17.206
OVER THE CLATTER
OF PRISON CHAINS.
喧闹声
监狱链。

07:17.241 --> 07:19.931
- I SAID
ISN'T THERE SOMETHING ODD
- 我说
难道没有什么奇怪的吗

07:19.965 --> 07:22.241
ABOUT BIKINI BOTTOM
SINCE WE GOT BACK?
关于比基尼泳裤
自从我们回来之后？

07:22.275 --> 07:23.413
- NO.
- 不。

07:23.448 --> 07:24.758
BUT YES!
但是是的！

07:24.793 --> 07:27.793
JUST LOOK AT THAT GIANT
MENACING BILLBOARD.
看看那个巨人
险恶的广告牌。

07:27.827 --> 07:31.413
IT'S MISSING A BOLT
ON THE BOTTOM RIGHT CORNER!
缺少一个螺栓
在右下角！

07:31.448 --> 07:33.241
- EVEN WORSE THAN THAT, PATRICK.
- 比那更糟糕，帕特里克。

07:33.275 --> 07:35.620
THE POLICE GOT NEW UNIFORMS.
警察换上了新制服。

07:35.655 --> 07:36.793
- OH, NO!
- 哦，不！

07:36.827 --> 07:39.413
WHAT DID THEY DO
WITH THOSE OLD ONES?
他们做了什么
与那些旧的？

07:39.448 --> 07:40.620
- AND YIKES!
- 哎呀！

07:40.655 --> 07:42.310
WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB?
发生了什么
去脆皮蟹吗？

07:44.965 --> 07:47.068
"THE DESIGNATED AREA
WHERE YOU ARE PERMITTED
“指定区域
在允许的地方

07:47.103 --> 07:49.068
"BY MAN RAY, YOUR RULER,
“曼·雷，你的统治者，

07:49.103 --> 07:52.137
TO OBTAIN SANDWICHES
USING MAN RAY DOLLARS"?
获取三明治
使用曼雷美元”？

07:52.172 --> 07:55.758
DO YOU SEE THE UNDERLYING
TRAGEDY IN ALL THIS?
你看到底层了吗
这一切都是悲剧吗？

07:55.793 --> 07:57.620
- I'M ALL OUT
OF MAN RAY DOLLARS?
- 我全力以赴
曼雷美元？

07:57.655 --> 07:59.068
- NO, PATRICK.
- 不，帕特里克。

07:59.103 --> 08:01.965
IT MEANS THAT WE SOMEHOW CHANGED
THE COURSE OF HISTORY
这意味着我们不知何故改变了
历史的进程

08:02.000 --> 08:03.655
WHEN WE WENT INTO THE PAST,
当我们回到过去，

08:03.689 --> 08:06.827
AND NOW, IN THIS REALITY,
MAN RAY IS RULER.
而现在，在这个现实中，
曼雷是统治者。

08:06.862 --> 08:09.103
OH, WE GOT TO DO SOMETHING.
- BUT WHAT?
哦，我们必须做点什么。
- 但是什么？

08:09.137 --> 08:11.275
- WHAT ANY SELF-RESPECTING
CITIZEN OF THE FREE WORLD
- 有什么自尊心
自由世界的公民

08:11.310 --> 08:13.034
WOULD DO IN A TIME OF CRISIS:
在危机时期会做的事：

08:13.068 --> 08:15.965
SEE IF I STILL HAVE A JOB.
看看我是否还有工作。

08:16.000 --> 08:19.344
- HEY, YOU'RE NOT EATING
FAST ENOUGH.
- 嘿，你没吃东西
足够快。

08:19.379 --> 08:21.413
- EXCUSE ME, SQUID--WHOA.
- 对不起，鱿鱼——哇。

08:21.448 --> 08:22.413
- YES?
- 是的？

08:22.448 --> 08:23.413
- [stammering]
- [结巴]

08:23.448 --> 08:24.448
BARNACLE BOY?
藤壶男孩？

08:24.482 --> 08:25.689
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?
你在这里做什么？

08:25.724 --> 08:27.827
- JUST TAKING STOCK
OF A WASTED LIFE.
- 只是盘点一下
浪费的生命。

08:27.862 --> 08:28.896
- ORDER UP!
- 订购！

08:28.931 --> 08:30.103
- MERMAID MAN!
- 美人鱼男人！

08:30.137 --> 08:31.517
AND HE'S WEARING A HAIRNET.
而且他戴着发网。

08:31.551 --> 08:33.551
- [sighs]
- WHAT HAPPENED?
- [叹气]
- 发生了什么？

08:33.586 --> 08:35.517
WHY ARE THE TWO
GREATEST HEROES EVER
为什么是两者
有史以来最伟大的英雄

08:35.551 --> 08:37.517
STUCK IN THIS GREASY SPOON,
卡在这个油腻的勺子里，

08:37.551 --> 08:39.724
NOT COMBATING THE EVILS
OF MAN RAY?
不与邪恶作斗争
曼雷？

08:39.758 --> 08:42.931
- I LOST THE DESIRE
AND THE PHYSIQUE TO FIGHT
- 我失去了欲望
以及战斗的体格

08:42.965 --> 08:44.448
LONG AGO, KID.
很久以前，孩子。

08:44.482 --> 08:47.862
FLIPPING PATTIES
IS SO MUCH EASIER ON THE JOINTS
翻转肉饼
关节轻松多了

08:47.896 --> 08:49.620
WHEN YOU'RE MY AGE.
当你到了我这个年纪的时候。

08:49.655 --> 08:51.931
- WHAT ABOUT THE YOUNGER
MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY?
- 年轻人呢
美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩？

08:51.965 --> 08:54.551
SURELY THEY REFUSED
TO SURRENDER WITHOUT A FIGHT.
他们肯定拒绝了
不战而降。

08:54.586 --> 08:57.000
- YOU GOT SPAGHETTI
FOR BRAINS, KID?
- 你有意大利面条
为了大脑，孩子？

08:57.034 --> 08:59.034
WE ARETHE YOUNGER ONES.
我们是年轻人。

08:59.068 --> 09:00.827
THE OLDER ONES...
年长的人...

09:00.862 --> 09:04.758
[sniffs]
BLESS THEIR SOULS...
[嗅嗅]
祝福他们的灵魂......

09:04.793 --> 09:08.931
HAVE BEEN IMMORTALIZED
IN THIS VERY RESTAURANT.
已被永垂不朽
就在这家餐厅。

09:08.965 --> 09:12.724
- I AM SO SORRY
FOR YOUR LOSS OF...YOURSELF.
- 我很抱歉
FOR YOUR LOSS OF...YOURSELF.

09:12.758 --> 09:14.965
- I HATE TO BREAK UP
THE MEMORIAL SERVICE,
- 我讨厌分手
追悼会，

09:15.000 --> 09:17.275
BUT WE'RE OUT OF TARTAR SAUCE
OUT HERE.
但我们的鞑靼酱已经用完了
在这里。

09:17.310 --> 09:19.482
- TARTAR SAUCE?
- 鞑靼酱？

09:19.517 --> 09:22.793
THE TOPPING THAT DESTROYED LIFE
AS WE KNEW IT.
摧毁生活的浇头
据我们所知。

09:22.827 --> 09:26.827
IF ONLY MY TARTAR SAUCE ATTACK
HADN'T FAILED THAT DAY,
如果只有我的鞑靼酱攻击
那天没有失败，

09:26.862 --> 09:30.379
WE WOULDN'T BE LIVING
IN THIS WASTELAND.
我们不会活下去
在这片荒原上。

09:32.551 --> 09:33.896
WE'RE ALREADY OUT?
我们已经出去了吗？

09:33.931 --> 09:34.931
- YUP.
- 是的。

09:34.965 --> 09:37.689
[chomping and gulping]
[咀嚼和吞咽]

09:37.724 --> 09:39.689
CHEWY BITS.
耐嚼的小块。

09:39.724 --> 09:41.275
[burps]
[打嗝]

09:43.896 --> 09:46.275
- I KNEW I RECOGNIZED YOU
FROM SOMEWHERE.
- 我知道我认出了你
来自某个地方。

09:46.310 --> 09:50.758
YOU WERE THERE, AND YOU ATE
THE TARTAR SAUCE ON THAT DAY!
你在那里，你吃了
那天的塔塔酱！

09:50.793 --> 09:53.517
DO YOU REALIZE
WHAT YOU'VE DONE?
你知道吗
你做了什么？

09:53.551 --> 09:54.827
- SORRY, MERMAID MAN.
- 对不起，美人鱼男人。

09:54.862 --> 09:56.241
WE DIDN'T MEAN TO DESTROY
YOUR LIVES
我们无意破坏
你的生活

09:56.275 --> 09:57.827
AND EVERYTHING YOU HELD DEAR.
以及您所珍视的一切。

09:57.862 --> 09:59.620
WHAT DO YOU SAY WE TRY
TO MAKE THINGS RIGHT?
你说我们会尝试什么
让事情变得正确？

09:59.655 --> 10:01.172
WITH YOUR HELP, OF COURSE.
当然需要您的帮助。

10:01.206 --> 10:06.137
- I'M NOT TEAMING UP WITH YOU
TO DO JACK-DIDDLY-SQUAT.
- 我不会和你组队
徒手深蹲。

10:08.034 --> 10:12.310
BESIDES, MAN RAY
HAS ME BY THE NECK.
此外，曼雷
掐着我的脖子。

10:12.344 --> 10:15.724
OH, EVIL!
哦，邪恶！

10:15.758 --> 10:18.206
- DOES THAT MEAN THAT THE DEFEAT
WAS SO TRAUMATIC
- 这是否意味着失败
太痛苦了

10:18.241 --> 10:20.793
THAT IT HAS GIVEN MAN RAY
A STRANGLEHOLD ON YOUR PSYCHE?
它给了曼雷
束缚你的心灵？

10:20.827 --> 10:22.482
- BARNACLES, NO!
- 藤壶，不！

10:22.517 --> 10:25.068
IT MEANS HE PUT
THIS ELECTRO-COLLAR ON ME
这意味着他把
我身上的这个电子项圈

10:25.103 --> 10:27.931
THAT WON'T ALLOW ME
TO LEAVE THE RESTAURANT.
那不允许我
离开餐厅。

10:27.965 --> 10:29.241
- OH.
- 哦。

10:29.275 --> 10:31.896
WELL, LET'S GET THAT NASTY THING
OFF OF YOU, HMM?
好吧，让我们来解决这个令人讨厌的事情
离开你了，嗯？

10:31.931 --> 10:33.172
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:33.206 --> 10:35.862
- HAVEN'T YOU TWO IDIOTS
DONE ENOUGH DAMAGE?
-你们这两个白痴不是吗
造成的伤害已经够多了吗？

10:35.896 --> 10:38.275
- UH!
I CAN'T GET A GOOD GRIP ON IT.
- 呃！
我无法很好地掌握它。

10:38.310 --> 10:41.275
MUST NEED A BETTER ANGLE.
HOLD ON.
必须需要更好的角度。
坚持，稍等。

10:41.310 --> 10:44.793
SORRY.
SORRY.
对不起。
对不起。

10:44.827 --> 10:46.827
HEY, PATRICK,
CAN YOU GIVE ME A HAND HERE?
嘿，帕特里克，
你能帮我一下吗？

10:46.862 --> 10:48.413
- KEEP AWAY FROM ME.
- 离我远点。

10:55.103 --> 10:56.000
crash!
碰撞！

11:05.275 --> 11:07.103
- TA-DA!
YOU'RE FREE.
- 达达！
你自由了。

11:07.137 --> 11:09.655
CAN WE COAX YOU AND BARNACLE BOY
OUT OF RETIREMENT
我们可以哄你和藤壶男孩吗
退休后

11:09.689 --> 11:11.620
TO SAVE THE KNOWN UNIVERSE?
拯救已知的宇宙？

11:11.655 --> 11:14.344
- I SUPPOSE YOU'VE PROVEN
YOUR METTLE, KID.
- 我想你已经证明了
你的勇气，孩子。

11:14.379 --> 11:16.620
BUT I'LL HAVE MY EYE
ON YOU TWO.
但我会用我的眼睛
你们两个。

11:16.655 --> 11:19.724
NOW, LET'S POP
THAT DIRTY BUBBLE.
现在，让我们开始吧
那个肮脏的泡沫。

11:19.758 --> 11:21.034
- ACTUALLY,
WE'RE FIGHTING MAN RAY.
- 事实上，
我们正在与曼雷作战。

11:21.068 --> 11:23.827
- OH, WELL, IN THAT CASE,
- 哦，那么，在这种情况下，

11:23.862 --> 11:27.758
LET THE LIGHTHOUSE OF JUSTICE
SHINE ON RAY MAN.
让正义的灯塔
闪耀雷曼。

11:27.793 --> 11:29.517
- OKAY, I SUPPOSE
THAT'S CLOSE ENOUGH.
- 好吧，我想
已经足够接近了。

11:29.551 --> 11:31.379
BACK TO THE PAST, GENTS,
回到过去，先生们，

11:31.413 --> 11:33.379
TO STOP YOU FROM EATING
THE TARTAR SAUCE AGAIN
阻止你吃东西
又是鞑靼酱

11:33.413 --> 11:35.137
FOR THE FIRST TIME...HMM.
第一次...嗯。

11:40.275 --> 11:42.482
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

11:44.931 --> 11:47.413
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

11:47.448 --> 11:49.931
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

11:49.965 --> 11:53.379
I'M READY TO RULE THE WORLD
AND ITS RICHES.
我已准备好统治世界
及其财富。

11:53.413 --> 11:56.000
- NOT SO FAST, MAN RAY.
- 别那么快，曼雷。

11:56.034 --> 11:58.896
- WE'VE GOT A LITTLE SURPRISE
FOR YOU.
- 我们有一点惊喜
为了您。

12:02.793 --> 12:06.137
- KEEP YOUR TONGUE
OUT OF MY TARTAR SAUCE!
- 保持你的舌头
我的鞑靼酱用完了！

12:06.172 --> 12:08.862
- IMPOSTERS!
- 冒名顶替者！

12:08.896 --> 12:11.310
- WHO YOU CALLIN' IMPOSTER,
IMPOSTER?
- 你说谁是冒名顶替者，
冒名顶替者？

12:11.344 --> 12:14.620
I MUST PREVENT OUR TARTAR SAUCE
FROM BEING EATEN
我必须防止我们的鞑靼酱
被吃掉

12:14.655 --> 12:17.241
BY THAT--THAT FOOL.
靠那个——那个傻瓜。

12:17.275 --> 12:19.310
- IF I WANT TO GET NEAR
MY TARTAR SAUCE,
- 如果我想靠近
我的塔塔酱，

12:19.344 --> 12:21.655
I GOT TO GO THROUGH ME FIRST.
我必须先通过我自己。

12:21.689 --> 12:23.551
- I'M GONNA MAKE ME EAT
THOSE WORDS.
- 我要让我吃东西
那些话。

12:23.586 --> 12:24.862
- BRING IT.
- 带上它。

12:24.896 --> 12:26.000
OOH!
哦！

12:27.275 --> 12:28.758
TAKE THIS.
拿着这个。

12:28.793 --> 12:30.827
- OOH!
- 哦！

12:32.103 --> 12:33.551
- I'LL NEVER LET YOU WIN.
- 我永远不会让你赢。

12:33.586 --> 12:35.689
- OH, YES, I WILL.
- 哦，是的，我会的。

12:35.724 --> 12:37.965
- WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THIS,
BARNACLE BOY?
- 你对此有何看法？
藤壶男孩？

12:38.000 --> 12:40.137
- TANGLED TIMELINE, MERMAID MAN.
I'M--
- 纠结的时间线，美人鱼人。
我是 -

12:40.172 --> 12:41.551
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

12:41.586 --> 12:44.896
YOU OLD COOTS PROVIDED ME
THE PERFECT DISTRACTION.
你们这些老傻瓜给了我
完美的分散注意力的方法。

12:44.931 --> 12:48.275
NOW PREPARE TO BE DISAPPEARED.
现在准备消失吧。

12:48.310 --> 12:51.896
- SOUNDS GOOD ON PAPER,
YOU PURVEYOR OF PURE EVIL.
- 纸面上听起来不错，
你是纯粹邪恶的传播者。

12:51.931 --> 12:54.034
BUT FORTUNATELY,
WE ALL KNOW
但幸运的是，
我们都知道

12:54.068 --> 12:57.068
WHAT HAPPENS TO PAPER
UNDERWATER.
纸张会发生什么变化
水下。

12:57.103 --> 13:00.413
BARNACLE BOY,
THE TARTAR SAUCE.
藤壶男孩，
鞑靼酱。

13:02.448 --> 13:03.827
- OOH!
- OOH!
- 哦！
- 哦！

13:03.862 --> 13:07.448
- WOW, I'VE NEVER EATEN
THAT MUCH TARTAR SAUCE.
- 哇，我从来没有吃过
那么多塔塔酱。

13:07.482 --> 13:09.413
- YES, YOU HAVE.
- 是的，你有。

13:09.448 --> 13:11.448
- WELL, IT SURE AIN'T
SITTIN' RIGHT.
- 嗯，这肯定不是
坐对了。

13:11.482 --> 13:13.000
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

13:13.034 --> 13:14.758
FOOLISH FOOLS!
愚蠢的傻瓜！

13:14.793 --> 13:18.172
ONCE AGAIN, YOUR BUFFOONERY
HAS GIVEN ME VICTORY.
再次，你的滑稽表演
给了我胜利。

13:20.310 --> 13:21.827
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

13:21.862 --> 13:23.827
OH, I'M GOING TO SAVOR THIS.
哦，我要尝尝这个。

13:23.862 --> 13:25.068
IT'S NOT EVERY DAY
这不是每一天

13:25.103 --> 13:28.448
I GET TO DEFEAT MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY
我要打败美人鱼人
和藤壶男孩

13:28.482 --> 13:30.448
THREE TIMES OVER.
三倍以上。

13:33.689 --> 13:37.689
- PATRICK, DON'T EAT
THE TARTAR SAUCE!
- 帕特里克，别吃东西
鞑靼酱！

13:37.724 --> 13:39.655
- HA!
YOU'RE TOO LATE.
- 哈！
你太晚了。

13:39.689 --> 13:41.896
YOUR FAT FRIEND
BEAT YOU TO IT.
你的胖朋友
打败你。

13:41.931 --> 13:45.482
NOW, PREPARE TO TASTE LASER.
现在，准备品尝激光吧。

13:46.931 --> 13:49.068
both:
WHAAAA!
两者：
哇啊啊！

13:49.103 --> 13:50.517
- SO HOW--
- 那么如何--

13:52.137 --> 13:53.862
- I TOLD YOU WE HAD TO GO BACK
FURTHER.
- 我告诉过你我们必须回去
进一步。

13:53.896 --> 13:54.862
- UH...
- 呃...

13:56.103 --> 13:58.344
- UP, UP, AND AWAY!
- 向上，向上，离开！

14:00.413 --> 14:02.379
- NOW, PATRICK!
- 现在，帕特里克！

14:07.275 --> 14:09.724
- I CAN'T GET MY HEAD
AROUND THIS.
- 我无法理解
围绕这个。

14:09.758 --> 14:12.103
WHERE ARE THEY ALL
COMING FROM?
他们都在哪里
来自？

14:12.137 --> 14:13.931
ANOTHER MACHINE?
另一台机器？

14:17.724 --> 14:19.000
- [laughs]
- [笑]

14:19.034 --> 14:21.620
I TOOK CARE
OF YOUR BLASTED TIME MACHINE.
我很照顾
你那该死的时间机器。

14:21.655 --> 14:23.517
[laughs evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

14:26.793 --> 14:29.689
- OH, I'VE GOT TO SIT DOWN
AND THINK THIS THROUGH.
- 哦，我得坐下
AND THINK THIS THROUGH.

14:29.724 --> 14:31.034
- GOTCHA!
- 明白了！

14:31.068 --> 14:32.586
YOU'LL HAVE PLENTY OF TIME
FOR THINKING
您将有充足的时间
用于思考

14:32.620 --> 14:34.275
IN THE STONY LONESOME.
在石质孤独中。

14:34.310 --> 14:36.896
- I'M SORRY.
DID YOU SAY SOMETHING?
- 对不起。
你有说什么吗？

14:36.931 --> 14:39.689
I'M STILL TRYING TO COMPREHEND
WHAT JUST HAPPENED HERE.
我仍在尝试理解
这里刚刚发生了什么。

14:39.724 --> 14:41.310
- IT'S PRETTY SIMPLE, REALLY.
- 这真的很简单。

14:41.344 --> 14:43.034
YOU WERE DEFEATED BY A CADRE
你被一个干部打败了

14:43.068 --> 14:46.137
OF CONTINUUM-CRUISING
CRIME STOPPERS.
连续巡航
犯罪制止者。

14:46.172 --> 14:48.551
THANK YOU,
SPONGEBOB AND PATRICK.
谢谢你，
海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

14:48.586 --> 14:50.413
all:
YOU'RE WELCOME.
全部：
不客气。

14:54.758 --> 14:56.724
all:
WHOA! HI, THERE.
全部：
哇啊！你好呀。

14:56.758 --> 14:58.241
- HELLO.
- HELLO.
- 你好。
- 你好。

14:58.275 --> 14:59.724
- HELLO.
- 你好。

14:59.758 --> 15:02.137
- WE JUST WANTED TO COME BACK
AND REVISIT THE DAY
- 我们只是想回来
回顾这一天

15:02.172 --> 15:05.275
THAT EVIL WAS DEFEATED FOREVER.
邪恶已被永远击败。

15:07.448 --> 15:09.931
- HOW YOU DOING?
- 你好吗？

15:13.241 --> 15:14.551
- WHOA!
- 哇！

15:17.103 --> 15:18.827
- HELLO.
- HELLO.
- 你好。
- 你好。

15:18.862 --> 15:20.275
- HELLO.
- 你好。

15:43.793 --> 15:45.517
- PATRICK, GUESS WHAT CAME
IN THE MAIL TODAY!
- 帕特里克，猜猜发生了什么
今天就在邮件中！

15:45.551 --> 15:47.551
- OH, WHAT?
- THIS.
- 哦，什么？
- 这。

15:47.586 --> 15:53.068
- "MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY
LOST EPISODE"?
- “美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩
丢失的一集”？

15:53.103 --> 15:53.965
STICK IT IN!
把它插进去！

15:57.551 --> 16:02.137
[adventure music]
[冒险音乐]

16:02.172 --> 16:03.965
- ♪ FASTER THAN LIGHT
- ♪ 比光还快

16:04.000 --> 16:05.965
♪ THEY'RE THERE
TO STOP CRIME ♪
♪ 他们就在那里
阻止犯罪♪

16:06.000 --> 16:07.862
♪ IT'S MERMAID MAN
♪ 这是美人鱼男人

16:07.896 --> 16:10.275
♪ AND BARNACLE BOY
both: YEAH!
♪ 和藤壶男孩
两人：是啊！

16:10.310 --> 16:12.724
- ♪ IF YOU'RE IN A JAM...
- ♪ 如果你陷入困境......

16:12.758 --> 16:14.931
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

16:14.965 --> 16:18.586
♪ IT'S MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY ♪
♪ 这是美人鱼男人
还有藤壶男孩 ♪

16:18.620 --> 16:20.379
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

16:20.413 --> 16:21.758
male announcer:
THE ADVENTURES
男主播：
冒险之旅

16:21.793 --> 16:24.034
OF MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY.
人鱼人的
还有藤壶男孩。

16:24.068 --> 16:26.034
TONIGHT'S EPISODE:
"THE SECRET MEETING."
今晚的剧集：
“秘密会议。”

16:26.068 --> 16:28.275
DEEP IN THE MER-CAVE,
在 MER-CAVE 深处，

16:28.310 --> 16:31.172
SOMETHING STRANGE
TAKES MERMAID MAN'S ATTENTION.
奇怪的事情
引起美人鱼男人的注意。

16:31.206 --> 16:32.827
- THE DIRTY BUBBLE?
- 肮脏的泡沫？

16:32.862 --> 16:34.862
WHAT'S HE DOING
AT THE BUS STOP?
他在做什么
在公交车站？

16:34.896 --> 16:36.344
- LOOKS LIKE HE'S GOT
A ONE-WAY TICKET
- 看起来他已经得到了
一张单程票

16:36.379 --> 16:38.689
TO BIKINI BOTTOM,
到比基尼下装，

16:38.724 --> 16:41.137
AND THERE'S ONLY ONE THING
THE DIRTY BUBBLE COULD BE UP TO
只有一件事
肮脏的泡沫可能会达到

16:41.172 --> 16:43.379
IN BIKINI BOTTOM,
BARNACLE BOY.
穿着比基尼泳裤，
藤壶男孩。

16:43.413 --> 16:45.551
- THAT'S RIGHT,
MERMAID MAN.
- 没错，
美人鱼男人。

16:45.586 --> 16:47.344
both:
EVIL!
两者：
邪恶！

16:50.275 --> 16:52.344
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

16:55.931 --> 16:58.206
announcer:
THE TERRIBLE MAN RAY.
播音员：
可怕的雷人。

16:58.241 --> 17:00.896
- I'M SO GLAD
YOU COULD MAKE IT.
- 我很高兴
你可以的。

17:00.931 --> 17:02.827
- I WOULDN'T MISS THIS
FOR THE WORLD, DIRTY.
- 我不会错过这个
对于世界来说，肮脏。

17:02.862 --> 17:04.241
[laughs]
[笑]

17:04.275 --> 17:06.517
announcer: THE MOST POWERFUL
OF ALL CRUSTACEANS,
播音员：最强
在所有甲壳类动物中，

17:06.551 --> 17:08.620
IT'S JUMBO SHRIMP.
这是大虾。

17:08.655 --> 17:11.379
IT'S THE ATOMIC FLOUNDER,
THE ABOMINATION
这是原子比目鱼，
可憎之物

17:11.413 --> 17:14.862
OF A NUCLEAR EXPERIMENT
GONE HORRIBLY WRONG.
核实验
错得很离谱。

17:14.896 --> 17:20.448
AND THE TERROR OF THE SEWERS,
THE MAN-EATING SINISTER SLUG.
以及下水道的恐怖，
邪恶的食人蛞蝓。

17:20.482 --> 17:23.586
- [laughs]
WE JOIN FORCES AT LAST.
- [笑]
我们终于联手了。

17:23.620 --> 17:25.793
- IT'S WORSE
THAN I COULD HAVE IMAGINED--
- 更糟了
超出我的想象——

17:25.827 --> 17:27.172
A TEAM-UP.
团队合作。

17:27.206 --> 17:30.586
- WELCOME TO THE BGATFBC.
- 欢迎来到 BGATFBC。

17:30.620 --> 17:33.827
[evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

17:35.517 --> 17:38.000
- APRIL 3RD, 12:00 NOON?
- 4 月 3 日中午 12:00？

17:38.034 --> 17:39.655
THAT'S TOMORROW.
那是明天。

17:39.689 --> 17:42.172
- HOLY--
- 圣哉--

17:42.206 --> 17:44.172
- HEY.
- 嘿。

17:44.206 --> 17:46.137
- DON'T WORRY.
I CAN FIX IT.
- 不用担心。
我能修好它。

17:48.344 --> 17:49.241
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:55.862 --> 17:57.689
- GRIPING GUPPIES,
MERMAID MAN.
- 紧握孔雀鱼，
美人鱼男人。

17:57.724 --> 17:59.137
WE GOT TO DO SOMETHING.
我们必须做点什么。

17:59.172 --> 18:00.793
- NOT SO FAST,
LITTLE FLIPPER.
- 没那么快，
小鳍状肢。

18:00.827 --> 18:02.931
WE'RE FAR TOO OUTMANNED.
我们的人手太多了。

18:02.965 --> 18:04.344
BUT FEAR NOT.
但不要害怕。

18:04.379 --> 18:08.034
I'M ALWAYS ONE STEP AHEAD
OF EVIL.
我总是领先一步
邪恶的。

18:08.068 --> 18:11.275
announcer: OUR HERO OF THE BRINE
PUTS OUT AN URGENT CALL.
播音员：我们的盐水英雄
发出紧急电话。

18:11.310 --> 18:13.862
- TO THE OCEAN'S
GREATEST HEROES.
- 到海洋
最伟大的英雄。

18:13.896 --> 18:15.206
- [unintelligible speech]
- [难以理解的言语]

18:15.241 --> 18:17.551
- YES, I CAN HOLD.
- 是的，我可以坚持。

18:21.689 --> 18:23.551
announcer:
MEANWHILE A SINISTER HORDE
播音员：
与此同时，邪恶的部落

18:23.586 --> 18:26.068
CONGREGATES
OUTSIDE HOTEL EVIL.
聚集地
邪恶酒店外。

18:26.103 --> 18:28.275
- RIGHT THIS WAY, GENTLEMEN.
- 先生们，这边走。

18:28.310 --> 18:31.034
- HEY, WHAT'S GOIN' ON
IN HERE?
- 嘿，发生了什么事
在这里？

18:31.068 --> 18:32.275
- HUH?
- 嗯？

18:32.310 --> 18:34.310
OH, I'M DREADFULLY SORRY,
GENTLEMEN.
哦，我非常抱歉，
先生们。

18:34.344 --> 18:36.241
YOU MUST BE IN THE WRONG ROOM.
你肯定走错房间了。

18:36.275 --> 18:40.620
THIS ROOM IS RESERVED
FOR THE BGATFBC.
此房间已预订
对于 BGATFBC。

18:40.655 --> 18:42.034
- THAT'S FUNNY.
- 那很好笑。

18:42.068 --> 18:44.241
I THOUGHT IT WAS SET ASIDE
FOR THE IJLSA.
我以为它被搁置了
为了 IJLSA。

18:44.275 --> 18:46.068
- IJLSA?
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？
- IJLSA？

18:46.103 --> 18:48.862
WHAT IN CORAL CAVERNS
IS THAT?
珊瑚洞里有什么
是这样吗？

18:48.896 --> 18:51.620
all:
MERMAID MAN AND BARNACLE BOY?
全部：
美人鱼男人和藤壶男孩？

18:51.655 --> 18:53.379
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

18:53.413 --> 18:56.310
NOW, BEFORE YOU HAVE TO SAY
GOOD-BYE,
现在，在您必须说之前
再见，

18:56.344 --> 18:58.551
SAY HELLO TO SOME FRIENDS.
向一些朋友问好。

19:01.896 --> 19:05.034
THE ELASTIC WAISTBAND.
弹性腰带。

19:05.068 --> 19:08.448
- GREET THE HOTTEST
CRIME FIGHTER IN THE COUNTRY,
- 迎接最热门的人
该国的犯罪斗士，

19:08.482 --> 19:10.103
PROFESSOR MAGMA.
玛格玛教授。

19:13.068 --> 19:17.620
- THE ELUSIVE MISS APPEAR.
- 难以捉摸的小姐出现了。

19:17.655 --> 19:22.034
AND THE PYRITE PONDERER,
WITH HIS HAIRNET OF KNOWLEDGE.
和黄铁矿思考者，
他知识渊博。

19:22.068 --> 19:23.965
- DO WE REALLY EXIST?
- 我们真的存在吗？

19:24.000 --> 19:26.034
- TOGETHER, WE ARE...
- 我们在一起...

19:26.068 --> 19:31.310
THE INTERNATIONAL JUSTICE LODGE
OF SUPER ACQUAINTANCES.
国际司法旅馆
超级熟人。

19:31.344 --> 19:32.793
- LET'S GET 'EM, BOYS.
- 让我们抓住他们，孩子们。

19:40.310 --> 19:44.068
- DO NOT TUSSLE
WITH THE BGATFBC.
- 不要扭打
与 BGATFBC 一起。

19:44.103 --> 19:45.551
- OOH!
- 哦！

19:47.275 --> 19:49.413
- VIOLENCE RESOLVES NOTHING.
- 暴力解决不了任何问题。

19:51.379 --> 19:53.172
- GOOD NIGHT,
BALLOON BOY.
- 晚安，
气球男孩。

19:53.206 --> 19:55.413
[laughs]
[笑]

19:55.448 --> 19:57.172
- PROFESSOR MAGMA, CATCH.
- 玛格玛教授，抓住。

20:02.137 --> 20:04.241
- STEP ASIDE,
YOU COPIOUS COD.
-退到一边，
你这个丰富的鳕鱼。

20:04.275 --> 20:06.068
MY BEEF IS WITH THE BUBBLE.
我对泡沫很不满。

20:06.103 --> 20:09.551
- CAREFUL, BARNACLE BOY.
HE'S GOT NUCLEAR TOUCH.
- 小心点，藤壶男孩。
他有核接触能力。

20:09.586 --> 20:11.137
- RAA!
- 拉阿！

20:13.206 --> 20:14.620
- NUCLEAR TOUCH!
- 核接触！

20:14.655 --> 20:15.862
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

20:15.896 --> 20:17.758
- I CAN'T WATCH.
- 我看不了。

20:23.275 --> 20:24.793
- FRACTURING FURNITURE!
- 破坏家具！

20:24.827 --> 20:26.482
HANG TIGHT, BUDDY.
坚持住，伙计。

20:38.965 --> 20:41.310
HANG IN THERE,
MY DARING DEPUTY.
坚持住，
我勇敢的副手。

20:44.206 --> 20:48.000
- YOUR DARING DEPUTY
IS NAPPING RIGHT NOW.
- 你勇敢的副手
现在正在小睡。

20:48.034 --> 20:50.896
BUT I'D BE HAPPY TO PASS ALONG
THE MESSAGE...
但我很乐意继续
消息...

20:50.931 --> 20:53.758
IF HE EVER WAKES UP, THAT IS.
如果他醒来的话，那就是。

20:53.793 --> 20:56.413
HA...HA...HA.
哈……哈……哈。

20:56.448 --> 20:58.206
- SWIRLING SHRIMP!
- 旋转的虾！

20:58.241 --> 21:01.034
THAT FIEND HAS TAKEN CONTROL
OF BARNACLE BOY.
那个恶魔已经控制了
藤壶男孩。

21:01.068 --> 21:03.517
- WHAT DO WE DO, MERMAID MAN?
- 我们该怎么办，美人鱼人？

21:03.551 --> 21:05.827
- I'M GLAD YOU ASKED.
- 我很高兴你问这个问题。

21:05.862 --> 21:08.310
I BELIEVE
IF THE ATOMIC FLOUNDER
我相信
如果原子比目鱼

21:08.344 --> 21:09.827
WERE TO TOUCH
THAT WRETCHED GROWTH,
要触摸
那可怜的成长，

21:09.862 --> 21:11.620
IT WOULD CAUSE
A CHAIN REACTION,
这会导致
连锁反应，

21:11.655 --> 21:14.586
REVERSING THE POLARITY
AT THE MOLECULAR LEVEL,
反转极性
在分子水平上，

21:14.620 --> 21:18.689
RESTORING BARNACLE BOY
TO HIS NATURAL STATE.
恢复藤壶男孩
回到他的自然状态。

21:18.724 --> 21:21.931
DOES THAT SOUND ABOUT RIGHT,
PROFESSOR MAGMA?
听起来对吗？
玛格玛教授？

21:21.965 --> 21:23.517
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

21:23.551 --> 21:25.206
- YOU'LL NEVER DO IT.
- 你永远不会这么做。

21:25.241 --> 21:27.344
YOU DON'T HAVE THE MOXIE.
你没有这个勇气。

21:27.379 --> 21:29.896
- THAT'S WHAT YOU THINK, CUR.
- 这就是你的想法，老家伙。

21:32.206 --> 21:33.137
SHIELD!
盾！

21:38.517 --> 21:40.827
[laughs]
[笑]

21:40.862 --> 21:42.896
- LOOK OUT, MERMAID MAN!
- 小心，美人鱼男人！

21:42.931 --> 21:44.206
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

21:50.482 --> 21:51.896
both:
YAY!
两者：
耶！

21:54.517 --> 21:59.586
- THE SINISTER SLUG'S SLIME
HAS YOU STATIONARY AND STIFF,
- 邪恶鼻涕虫的粘液
你是静止不动的吗？

21:59.620 --> 22:02.620
WHICH MEANS YOUR TIME IS UP,
FRIEND.
这意味着你的时间到了，
朋友。

22:03.724 --> 22:09.172
- NOT NUCLEAR TOOOOOOUCH!
- 不是核太！

22:10.931 --> 22:13.896
- GREAT GRAVY!
WHAT JUST HAPPENED?
- 很棒的肉汁！
刚刚发生了什么？

22:13.931 --> 22:15.689
- I'LL TELL YOU ABOUT IT LATER.
- 我稍后会告诉你。

22:15.724 --> 22:17.862
NOW LET'S TAKE OUT THE TRASH.
现在我们来倒垃圾吧。

22:19.275 --> 22:22.103
- PLEASE, UTILIZE MY HAIRNET
OF KNOWLEDGE
- 请使用我的发网
知识的

22:22.137 --> 22:23.241
FOR THIS ENDEAVOR.
为了这一努力。

22:23.275 --> 22:25.137
- THANK YOU, PONDERER.
- 谢谢你，沉思者。

22:25.172 --> 22:27.551
- NO, NO!
YOU GUYS DON'T UNDERSTAND.
- 不，不！
你们不明白。

22:27.586 --> 22:29.241
IT'S NOT WHAT YOU THINK.
这不是你想的那样。

22:33.689 --> 22:35.103
- YOU REALLY THOUGHT
- 你真的这么想

22:35.137 --> 22:37.000
YOU WERE GOING TO GET AWAY
WITH IT, DIDN'T YOU?
你要离开
有了它，不是吗？

22:37.034 --> 22:41.413
FESS UP, VILLAINS.
WHAT'S THE BGATFBC?
坦白吧，恶棍们。
什么是 BGATFBC？

22:41.448 --> 22:44.655
- IT STANDS FOR "THE BAD GUYS
ALL TOGETHER FOR BOOK CLUB."
- 它代表“坏人”
一切为了读书俱乐部。”

22:44.689 --> 22:46.379
- BOOK CLUB?
- 读书俱乐部？

22:46.413 --> 22:47.793
YOU MEAN YOU WEREN'T
你的意思是你不是

22:47.827 --> 22:50.068
GOING TO DESTROY A LIBRARY
OR SOMETHING?
去毁掉一座图书馆
或者什么？

22:50.103 --> 22:53.034
- WHY WOULD WE DO THAT?
WE'RE ALMOST TO THE NEW CHAPTER.
- 我们为什么要这么做？
我们即将翻开新篇章。

22:53.068 --> 22:56.448
- WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO,
LOCK US UP FOR READING?
- 你要做什么，
把我们关起来看书？

22:56.482 --> 22:59.551
- YEAH, YOU CAN'T IMPRISON US
FOR READING.
- 是的，你不能监禁我们
供阅读。

22:59.586 --> 23:00.862
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

23:00.896 --> 23:02.931
REMEMBER, KIDS,
记住，孩子们，

23:02.965 --> 23:06.379
NO ONE CAN IMPRISON YOU
FOR READING.
没有人可以监禁你
供阅读。

23:09.655 --> 23:11.310
- HEY, WHAT HAPPENED?
- 嘿，发生了什么事？

23:11.344 --> 23:13.551
WHY ARE THOSE SQUIGGLES
ON THE SCREEN?
为什么是那些花体字
在屏幕上？

23:13.586 --> 23:15.758
- THOSE ARE CALLED
"END CREDITS," PATRICK.
- 那些被称为
“片尾字幕，”帕特里克。

23:15.793 --> 23:17.068
- END CREDITS?
- 片尾字幕？

23:17.103 --> 23:19.482
BUT I DON'T WANT IT TO END.
但我不想结束。

23:19.517 --> 23:23.965
- THAT'S WHY NEPTUNE GAVE US
THE REWIND BUTTON.
- 这就是海王星给我们的原因
快退按钮。

23:24.000 --> 23:25.620
- THANK YOU, NEPTUNE!
- 谢谢你，海王星！

23:34.344 --> 23:37.344
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

23:37.379 --> 23:45.206
♪
♪
♪
♪

♪